  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan uses a split soul method to divide a portion of his soul into a first split soul body. That clone undergoes tribulation outside the sovereign immortal aperture and becomes an immortal on time path. The clone’s first aperture becomes a high grade time path blessed land that Fang Yuan names Spring Autumn blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        1480
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the change, he says he became a time path Gu Immortal, his cultivation rose, strength path dao marks were removed, and wisdom Gu grew hesitant because of the split soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1481
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The clone’s soul has already received the maximum portion from Fang Yuan; further soul foundation would disrupt its time path cultivation. Time path methods still complement that clone’s cultivation enough that the advantages outweigh the disadvantages.",
      "chapters": [
        1482
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits-and-work",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The body is named outright as Fang Yuan’s rank six Gu Immortal time path clone.",
      "chapters": [
        1484
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-rank-six-clone",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unlike Spectral Soul’s split soul clones, which often focus on one path so they do not expose the Demon Venerable, Fang Yuan’s time path clone is easy to expose. He does not need it to go outside and fight; its motive is to make use of the light of wisdom.",
      "chapters": [
        1586
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "light-of-wisdom-role",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spring Autumn Cicada is covered on Spring Autumn Cicada. Thought, will, and emotion under the light of wisdom are covered on thought, will, and emotion.",
      "chapters": [],
